      "message": "This is changing the getParameters calling convention between AIDL and HIDL,  adding Eric and Jean-Michel for review.\n\nWith this change, getParameters cannot embed an argument in the parameter key for AIDL, rather the response must exhaustively enumerate possibilities for an input argument.",
